{
  "_source": "UV-A5 (docs/eras/uv.md, machines 7, 8 and 22, lines 5, 18 and 22). Real processes: LIGA X-ray lithography (KIT, Karlsruhe: a PMMA resist exposed through a gold-on-membrane mask, developed in the GG developer); antiproton production on a tungsten/iridium target (CERN's AD and ELENA); muon-catalysed fusion of D-T at liquid-hydrogen temperature (Alvarez 1956, Jones et al. at LAMPF, J-PARC); Penning-trap storage (CERN's BASE) and the antiproton-catalysed ICAN-II microfission pellet (Penn State, Lewis et al.).",
  "_how_it_is_used": [
    "Read by server_scripts/grindless/uv/accelerators.js at every server load. startup_scripts/grindless/uv/accelerators.js registers the machines, recipe types and the ids F1 did not.",
    "types.<type>.recipes: one recipe per entry, id grindless:<type>/<name>. itemsIn / itemsOut: { id, count }; kept: items needed in a bus but never used up; chancedIn / chancedOut: { id, count, chance } with chance out of 10,000 (GTM's chanced input: 200 = the target wears 2 % a run); fluidsIn / fluidsOut: { id, amount }; charge: fluids needed in a hatch but never drained. eut and duration are the final figures; cleanroom: true asks GTM's cleanroom; orbit: true limits the recipe to Earth orbit (G.orbits.earth).",
    "synchrotron (EU in): c1-c3 the LIGA line at VA[UV] (491,520 EU/t); c4 antiprotons at 4 A UV (2,097,152 EU/t). gtca:proton items come from GTCA's COMET (gtceu:comet/proton_simple: 9 protons a run); 16 stand for the doc's 1,000 mB; most of the beam recombines to hydrogen (250 mB back).",
    "muon_catalysed_fusion: a generator type; eut is the EU/t GIVEN (the script writes -eut). 786,432 EU/t = 1.5 A UV; the type stays out of server_scripts/grindless/power/generators.js TYPES, so it is not doubled (docs/research/uv-s0.md, S0-6). 500 mB of liquid D-T holds 250 mB of tritium: the blanket breeds back 150 mB (60 %), the other 100 mB (40 %) is make-up from IV's tritium removal facility.",
    "antimatter_storage (EU in): every row carries orbit: true. c1 at 2 A UV (1,048,576 EU/t).",
    "The other types are GTM's own machines: rows keyed by our new items or fluids, so none can hide a GTM recipe."
  ],
